title: Appwrite 2.5.1 security patch for self-hosted deployments
date: 2026-10-21
cover: /images/changelog/2026-10-13.avif
tags: security, infrastructure, console
---

Appwrite 2.5.1 refreshes the outbound TLS trust store after the eMudhra certificate compromise. Upgrade your self-hosted instance to apply the fix.

This patch includes:

- Refresh outbound TLS trust so Appwrite rejects the compromised eMudhra certificate chains. TLS verification remains enabled.
- Update the self-hosted Console from 1.2.74 to 1.2.97.

